# Interactions of the "u14_mouse" gallery (U14): the popups driven by the mouse. main.screenH is
# pinned to 720, so a popup of height h sits at y = floor((720 - h) / 2) and x is centred on 640
# at both acceptance screens.
frames 2
# open the message popup; the host button under the dim still shows its hover state
move 100 30
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
# a click outside the popup does nothing (the popup gets all input)
click LEFTBUTTON
# hover Ok, then click it: closed from its own button (OnKeyUp -> onClick -> ClosePopup)
move 640 399
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
# two-button confirm: Cancel, then Delete
move 100 60
click LEFTBUTTON
move 680 383
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
move 100 60
click LEFTBUTTON
move 600 383
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
